{"id": 29, "ts": 1780630559.1847188, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "james_carter", "message": "I remain inclined to recommend Candidate\u202fA, but Sarah\u2019s clarification that we have **no concrete evidence of A\u2019s stress resilience** and that their communication style may be resistant to criticism sharpens the risk profile. While A\u2019s technical strengths (anticipating danger, complex\u2011connection insight, spatial vision) and leadership are compelling, the lack of demonstrated calm under pressure and the hint of unorganized behavior could undermine crew coordination on long\u2011haul flights. Compared with Candidate\u202fB, who *does* handle stress very well, A\u2019s unknown resilience becomes a more serious gap. Unless we can obtain a clear example of A staying composed in a crisis, I\u2019m less confident that A outweighs B\u2019s proven stress handling, even with B\u2019s interpersonal flaws."}
